            'description': 'I deeply understand Chairman James Soong\'s concerns regarding national unity and cross-strait stability. As president, my responsibility is to unite everyone on this land, regardless of party or generation. Facing external threats, we cannot afford internal friction; facing internal competition, we must respect democratic norms. While my administration always strives to improve, we are steadily leading Taiwan toward the global stage, unlike Mr. Han, who only knows how to tear this country apart through anger and polarization.'
