        "pk": 21013,
        "fields": {
            "answer": 21012,
            "candidate": 67,
            "answer_feedback": "Attempting to direct the political blame toward KMT-era procurement decisions triggers a severe backlash across the media. While this option satisfies hardcore deep-green supporters who wish to brand the KMT as the root cause of military weakness, average middle-class families and urban intellectuals find this calculated political maneuvering highly uncharitable and disrespectful during a time of national mourning. The KMT capitalizes on this, fiercely accusing your administration of 'exploiting a national tragedy to escape governing responsibility', chipping your professional commander-in-chief aura and allowing the opposition to reclaim a portion of the moral high ground."
        }
